01_sldsc_make_annot.sh

Creates annotations based on input gene set files. Ours can be found in the data directory. Requires a gene coordinate file, which we also have in our data directory, and LD reference panels.

create_gene_coords.R

Makes the gene coordinate file, based on our MAGMA snp2gene annotation, so using NCBI build 37.3 gene locations.

02_make_ld_scores.sh

Creates LD scores from the annotations. Requires a SNP list.

03_partitioned_heritability.sh

Calculates S-LDSC enrichments for each gene set.

combined_sldsc_plot.R

Creates combined plot of S-LDSC enrichments on BrainSpan and GTEx gene sets.
